      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPARKLING WHEELS (2) is a solid beginner and with a good start can clear the draw. Latest effort finished 4th over 515m at this track beaten 6 lengths (30.33) behind Mighty Henry in a Grade 5 on July 24. Looks well placed here and rates a key player. Expected to be in the finish. ZIPPING SURREY (5) placed two runs ago then again in the money last time when third (26.67) at Bulli in a Mix. Well placed here and should do much better. MIDNIGHT MOHAWK (1) stretches out further in journey and is having her first try at the trip. In the money last start when second (22.96) at Maitland over 400m. With even luck and a clean start can sneak into the finish. INDIGO PEARL (7) can run a bold race on best form.",
